# Generated run output. Validation reports and charts carry performance numbers from a
# specific data snapshot and config; committing them would leave numbers in the tree with
# nothing tying them to the run that produced them. `ValidationReport.write` creates the
# directory itself.
reports/

# Vendor market data must not be redistributed (see docs/06-open-questions.md Q11)
tests/fixtures/real/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
